repository-code: "https://github.com/JUFALC/swiss100-gds-item-nonresponse"
abstract: "Stata and R code for the analysis of item non-response in the Geriatric Depression Scale (GDS-15 and GDS-4) among centenarians in the Swiss Centenarian Study (SWISS100), and for a Monte Carlo simulation comparing scoring strategies for incomplete GDS answers."
keywords:
  - centenarians
  - geriatric depression scale
  - item non-response
  - missing data
  - imputation
